    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IT HAS YOUR FACE. Now it wants your life. Hide, seek, and try to kill your clone in this deceptively simple first-person horror roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ce610bd53d770d012fee067afe8c86ca.poster.avif?t=1754940018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ce610bd53d770d012fee067afe8c86ca.webm?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ce610bd53d770d012fee067afe8c86ca.mp4?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR CLONE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your clone is hiding among the crowd, ready to kill you when you\u2019re most vulnerable. Endure procedural paranoia as you search to find your doppelganger before they find you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/86602a340f4c1998f663e22907ed8e4b.poster.avif?t=1754940018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/86602a340f4c1998f663e22907ed8e4b.webm?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/86602a340f4c1998f663e22907ed8e4b.mp4?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILL YOUR CLONE</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for weapons, manage limited ammo, and prepare carefully to strike. If your assassination fails, you\u2019ll lose the opportunity to stalk from the shadows.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/0d952b856dcb991c9090f717e851b26c.poster.avif?t=1754940018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/0d952b856dcb991c9090f717e851b26c.webm?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/0d952b856dcb991c9090f717e851b26c.mp4?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIOLOGICAL HORRORS</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll gain a greater understanding of your cursed fate and reveal terrifying new threats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ffa04ebd5a1b24d03c346936bb01be3c.poster.avif?t=1754940018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ffa04ebd5a1b24d03c346936bb01be3c.webm?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ffa04ebd5a1b24d03c346936bb01be3c.mp4?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>A BETTER YOU</strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite elements offer upgrades and improvements, giving you greater flexibility to endure increasingly complex challenges.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/efe872004b1a508fb605495ae945208a.poster.avif?t=1754940018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/efe872004b1a508fb605495ae945208a.webm?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/efe872004b1a508fb605495ae945208a.mp4?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER MAYHEM</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By popular demand, the Early Access version will include a PVP mode. Play hide and seek and eliminate your friends in this game of 1 v (the same) 1.\u00a0\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
