 lose the opportunity to stalk from the shadows.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/0d952b856dcb991c9090f717e851b26c.poster.avif?t=1754940018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/0d952b856dcb991c9090f717e851b26c.webm?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/0d952b856dcb991c9090f717e851b26c.mp4?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIOLOGICAL HORRORS</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll gain a greater understanding of your cursed fate and reveal terrifying new threats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ffa04ebd5a1b24d03c346936bb01be3c.poster.avif?t=1754940018\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ffa04ebd5a1b24d03c346936bb01be3c.webm?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506530/extras/ffa04ebd5a1b24d03c346936bb01be3c.mp4?t=1754940018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>A BETTER YOU</strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite elements offer upgrades and improvements, giving you greater flexibility to endure increasingly complex challenges.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/