    "short_description": "IT HAS YOUR FACE. Now it wants your life. Hide, seek, and try to kill your clone in this deceptively simple first-person horror roguelite.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt blends Guess Who with Hitman, and its demo is one of the best I've played in ages. It's an ingenious concept.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cThe demo has provoked in me some of the most pulse-quickening paranoia since the days of DayZ. I remain both intrigued and perturbed by the more overtly horror-flavoured antagonist variants that the final game will feature.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s a simple concept that\u2019s cleverly implemented and gets incredibly nerve-wracking as you make your way through the crowds knowing that one of them is wearing your face. Highly recommended\u201d<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>",
